WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.608 --> 00:00:11.509
One form per course. The link
has already chosen school and term.

2
00:00:11.609 --> 00:00:18.510
Your email and kennitala (Icelandic ID
number) – they link the answer to you.

3
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:23.511
Pick the course. Only your own
courses are offered.

4
00:00:23.611 --> 00:00:30.513
Current draft: the course's
sessions as they stand now.

5
00:00:30.613 --> 00:00:40.378
Want a session moved, or given a time?
Propose a change.

6
00:00:40.478 --> 00:00:46.379
It is a proposal – the office
looks at it before anything changes.

7
00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:53.380
Weeks: choose all, then
untick the ones you do not teach.

8
00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:57.382
Times: one click =
suits well.

9
00:00:57.482 --> 00:01:03.383
Two clicks = does not suit.
Three clear it. Leave the rest blank.

10
00:01:03.483 --> 00:01:09.384
Rooms: the same clicks.
“Does not suit” puts a room last.

11
00:01:09.484 --> 00:01:16.927
Room not listed? Find another room –
search any room.

12
00:01:17.027 --> 00:01:21.929
Teachers: tick what kind
of sessions each one teaches.

13
00:01:22.029 --> 00:01:29.693
Someone missing from Ugla?
Say so in the box below.

14
00:01:29.793 --> 00:01:35.160
Note: anything else,
in your own words.

15
00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:40.162
Summary: check
what will be sent.

16
00:01:40.262 --> 00:01:45.164
Send.
You can send again – the last one counts.

17
00:01:45.264 --> 00:01:51.165
Another course? Pick it here
and fill in its form the same way.
